pass in quick on jo0123456789a0a inet6 proto udp from 2001:db8:1::100 to 2620:fe::fe port 53 label "jo-75a5c7da9d81" keep state (if-bound)
# defaults: final (quick), so that no rule of the host's own pf.conf after the anchor line changes them
block drop out quick on jo0123456789a0a all
pass in quick on jo0123456789a0a all label "jo-11068b31a222" keep state (if-bound)
